---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | AI Hub Pro" description="Read our privacy policy to understand how we manage data and user information.">
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-black mb-10 text-slate-900 tracking-tighter italic">Privacy <span class="text-blue-600">Policy</span></h1>
        
        <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 space-y-8">
            <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs">Last Updated: August 2024</p>
            
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 underline decoration-blue-500 decoration-4">1. Introduction</h2>
                <p>Welcome to AI Hub Pro. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it. This policy explains how we handle information when you visit our AI directory.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 underline decoration-blue-500 decoration-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>We do not require users to create accounts. We may collect non-personal information such as browser type and IP address through cookies to improve our USA-focused user experience.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 underline decoration-blue-500 decoration-4">3. Third-Party Links</h2>
                <p>Our website contains links to external AI tools like ChatGPT, Claude, and Midjourney. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these third-party websites.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 underline decoration-blue-500 decoration-4">4. USA Compliance</h2>
                <p>Our website is optimized for users in the United States and follows standard digital privacy guidelines. We do not knowingly collect data from children under 13.</p>
            </section>

